No test file references `TerminalTabStrip.agentPopover` or `TerminalStatusBar.diagnosisSegment` by name (both are private), and grepping found no test asserting on `store.terminals.addRunTab` being called with `"claude"` vs. a seeded command line — so the divergence between the two `onInvestigate` closures (seeded prompt vs. literal `"claude"`) noted in section 3 is untested by both the unit suite and the UI suite.

